+// frame's period (start to start, the cap's wait included), the parts of it (the game's logic up to SIM_Render, the
+// events, the ImGui frame, the frame renderer incl. upload, the V-blank IRQ, ImGui's render, the swap, the cap's wait,
+// the sound step), the upload alone, the frame skip state, and 6 numbers the bridge sets (SIM_FrameLogExtra). Costs a
